{'symbol': 'GD', 'date': '2022-05-17 11:30:00', 'title': 'GENERAL DYNAMICS MISSION SYSTEMS RECEIVES NSA CONTRACT FOR HIGH ASSURANCE ETHERNET ENCRYPTOR', 'text': 'HIGH-SPEED SECURITY SOLUTION PROVIDES SCALABLE ENCRYPTION TO PROTECT CLASSIFIED HIGH-AVAILABILITY DATA CENTERS AND CLOUD ENVIRONMENTS, SECURING CRITICAL INFORMATION ACCESS, SHARING AND COLLECTION FROM AROUND THE GLOBE FAIRFAX, VA. , MAY 17, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- GENERAL DYNAMICS MISSION SYSTEMS ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS BEEN AWARDED A CONTRACT FROM THE NATIONAL SECURITY AGENCY (NSA) TO DESIGN, DEVELOP, TEST AND DELIVER A CERTIFIABLE 400 GBPS HIGH-ASSURANCE ENCRYPTION SOLUTION THAT IS COMPLIANT WITH THE ETHERNET DATA ENCRYPTION CRYPTOGRAPHIC INTEROPERABILITY SPECIFICATION (EDE-CIS).'}